WEBVTT

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:31.712
Ni wakati tuliopewa,kama tusemavyo.

00:04:31.712 --> 00:04:35.785
Sasa,tunasema zawadi ndani ya zawadi

00:04:35.785 --> 00:04:38.352
ni nafasi halisi.

00:04:38.352 --> 00:04:42.918
Unachoshukuru kwa hili ni nafasi,

00:04:42.918 --> 00:04:44.876
na sio kile ulichopewa,

00:04:44.876 --> 00:04:46.855
kwa sababu kama hicho kitu kingekuwa sehemu nyingine

00:04:46.855 --> 00:04:50.191
na hukuwa na nafasi ya kukifaidi,

00:04:50.191 --> 00:04:52.436
kufanya chochote nacho,

00:04:52.436 --> 00:04:55.026
usingeshukuru.

00:04:55.026 --> 00:04:59.169
Nafasi ni zawadi katika kila zawadi,

00:04:59.169 --> 00:05:01.521
na tunao huu msemo,